msgid ""
"The directory tree below is a curated depth-2 snapshot of the repository "
"directories. For a current deterministic snapshot, run "
"`man/scripts/gen_repo_map.sh --repo-root . --doc-dir man`; its default "
"output uses depth 3 and excludes generated/build directories. `src/mod/` "
"is expanded in the module table because the curated snapshot only shows "
"`src/include` and `src/mod`."
