#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/03-repo-map.md:199
#: 999563334a914df89edbed16a543677b
msgid ""
"**Naming**: Core files are `switch_<area>.c` / `switch_<area>.h`. Modules"
" are `mod_<name>` under a category directory. Config files are XML named "
"`<feature>.conf.xml` under `autoload_configs/`."
msgstr ""
"**命名**：核心文件为 `switch_<area>.c` / `switch_<area>.h`。模块为分类目录下的 "
"`mod_<name>`。配置文件为 `autoload_configs/` 下名为 `<feature>.conf.xml` 的 XML。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/03-repo-map.md:200
#: 3dbd2b49b62a4278895aaf1fe424ed74
msgid ""
"**Layering**: `src/switch.c` → core (`switch_core_*`, RTP, IVR, XML) → "
"loadable modules. Modules call into `src/include/`; they must not become "
"a second core. Bundled libs stay in `libs/` and are linked by the core or"
" by specific modules."
msgstr ""
"**分层**：`src/switch.c` → 核心（`switch_core_*`、RTP、IVR、XML）→ 可加载模块。模块调用 "
"`src/include/`；不得演变成第二套核心。捆绑库留在 `libs/`，由核心或特定模块链接。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/03-repo-map.md:201
#: e95cf4f8684849ee841764b299265be9
msgid ""
"**Module boundaries**: Category folders are the ownership boundary "
"(endpoint vs application vs codec). Enable/disable is `modules.conf`, not"
" `#ifdef` sprawl in the core. Out-of-tree modules can be cloned via "
"`modules.conf` git-source lines (`src/mod/Makefile.am`)."
msgstr ""
"**模块边界**：分类目录即所有权边界（端点 vs 应用 vs 编解码器）。启用/禁用通过 `modules.conf`，而不是在核心里铺开 "
"`#ifdef`。树外模块可通过 `modules.conf` 的 git-source 行克隆（`src/mod/Makefile.am`）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/03-repo-map.md:202
#: 6f01ea6bb0c64c0faa78ed8a0ce9ae67
msgid ""
"**Config vs code**: Runtime behavior is XML under `conf/<profile>/`, not "
"compiled constants. The preprocessor (`X-PRE-PROCESS` / `#include`) "
"flattens to `freeswitch.xml.fsxml` at start."
msgstr ""
"**配置 vs 代码**：运行时行为是 `conf/<profile>/` 下的 XML，而非编译期常量。预处理器（`X-PRE-PROCESS`"
" / `#include`）在启动时展平为 `freeswitch.xml.fsxml`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/03-repo-map.md:203
#: a16492118b294e77ae0063241e6677de
msgid ""
"**Scripts and tooling**: packaging in `scripts/packaging/` and `debian/`;"
" CI glue in `scripts/ci/` and `.github/`; maintainer gdb in "
"`support-d/gdb/`."
msgstr ""
"**脚本与工具**：打包在 `scripts/packaging/` 与 `debian/`；CI 粘合在 `scripts/ci/` 与 "
"`.github/`；维护者 gdb 在 `support-d/gdb/`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/03-repo-map.md:204
#: 0fc62249c476418283661d83797559ba
msgid ""
"**Tests**: core unit tests in `tests/unit/` (libfreeswitch only). Some "
"modules carry their own `test/` trees (for example Sofia SIPp scenarios "
"under `src/mod/endpoints/mod_sofia/test/`)."
msgstr ""
"**测试**：核心单元测试在 `tests/unit/`（仅 libfreeswitch）。部分模块自带 `test/` 目录（例如 Sofia "
"SIPp 场景位于 `src/mod/endpoints/mod_sofia/test/`）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/03-repo-map.md:205
#: 0e44cb44c934464cbfef1d9cf35a983f
msgid ""
"**Build systems**: Autotools is the supported Unix path. "
"`src/CMakeLists.txt` exists but is historical (CMake 2.6 comment). "
"Windows uses the `.sln` / `w32/` project files."
msgstr ""
"**构建系统**：Autotools 是受支持的 Unix 路径。`src/CMakeLists.txt` 存在但属历史遗留（CMake 2.6 "
"注释）。Windows 使用 `.sln` / `w32/` 工程文件。"

